//   set        - Cache set index
//   way        - Cache way that was accessed/filled
//   paddr      - Physical address being accessed
//   PC         - Program counter
//   victim_addr- Address of the evicted line (0 if no eviction or hit)
//   type       - Access type: LOAD, RFO, PREFETCH, or WRITEBACK
//   hit        - 1 if this was a cache hit, 0 if cache fill (miss)
